## 🔵 Communication Rules

### When starting a task, always output this block first:

```
## Task: [component name]
**Reference:** ui-reference.html → [describe the section, e.g. "checkout form section, lines ~120-180"]
**File to create:** components/v2/[path]
**Props interface:** [list props, copied from existing component]
**Files I will NOT touch:** [list]
**Question before proceeding:** [any ambiguity to resolve]
```

### When you are uncertain
- Do not guess and proceed — state the uncertainty and ask
- Offer 2–3 options maximum, with your recommendation
- Wait for a response before writing code

### When you finish a component
- Show a summary of what was built
- List any deviations from `ui-reference.html` (even minor ones) with reason
- Ask: "Ready to move to the next component, or any changes needed here?"

### Prohibited phrases (do not use these to justify unplanned work)
- "While I'm here, I also..."
- "I noticed X could be improved, so I..."
- "I refactored this to be cleaner..."
- "I took the liberty of..."

