## 🗂️ Reference Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `ui-reference.html` | Single source of truth for all UI design |
| `UI_RELEASE_PLAN.md` | Task checklist — only work on checked-out tasks |
| `lib/flags.ts` | Feature flag helper |
| `components/v2/` | All new UI components live here |

---

## Release Phase Awareness

Always know which phase is active. Ask if unsure.

| Phase | What's allowed |
|-------|---------------|
| 0 — Prep | No component work yet |
| 1 — Build v2 | Create in `components/v2/` only |
| 2 — Flag swap | Edit `pages/` files to add flag switch |
| 3 — Canary | No code changes unless hotfix |
| 4 — Cleanup | Delete old components, remove flags |

Working outside the current phase = blocked, propose to user first.
